WEBVTT

00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:15,200
Have you seen those patch products where they say they're using frequencies to help people with all sorts of problems?

00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,200
I was skeptical, but I know someone who has was allergic to everything.

00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,200
It had several issues, and now she's better.

00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,200
Yes, I have heard of those two.

00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,200
We have used them.

00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:33,200
We've had them with our store different times, but we don't carry them currently.

00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,200
And I do think that they have efficacy.

00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:45,200
They can't argue with a lot of the testimonials that are out there of people that said they thought that it really helped them.

00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:57,200
So, I think there can be benefit to them, but just to chose again how frequencies can be beneficial to you.

00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:02,200
And I think really how that works, I think, well, how does the patch actually put out frequencies?

00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:17,200
I think what the patch does is it's doing similar to the phone things, is that you are exposed to frequencies, and it changes those to be beneficial frequencies for you.

00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:32,700
No, again, I've had some people that have used those and say that it doesn't help them at all, but you could hear that about everybody too.

00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:38,700
But I do think it can have efficacy, I think it can have benefits.

